-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,25.3 150.0,68.7 280.0,112.1' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='51.7' cy='35.9' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='57.7' y='31.9'>(−6,6)</text><text x='23.2' y='178.8' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='10'>y = x² + 5x</text><text x='159.5' y='54.9' fill='#f0a30a' font-size='10'>y = −x</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 99.4H294.0M242.0 214.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='51.7' y1='96.4' x2='51.7' y2='102.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='48.7' y='113.4' font-size='10'>-6</text><line x1='115.1' y1='96.4' x2='115.1' y2='102.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='112.1' y='113.4' font-size='10'>-4</text><line x1='178.5' y1='96.4' x2='178.5' y2='102.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='175.5' y='113.4' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='239.0' y1='162.9' x2='245.0' y2='162.9' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='226.0' y='166.9' font-size='10'>-6</text><line x1='239.0' y1='67.6' x2='245.0' y2='67.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='226.0' y='71.6' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='239.0' y1='35.9' x2='245.0' y2='35.9' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='226.0' y='39.9' font-size='10'>6</text></svg></div><div class='res'>\\(a=5\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"area","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2010-RESERVA_1.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2010-reserva-1-7","n":7,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sean las matrices \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&2&3\\\\\\alpha&1&3\\\\0&2&\\alpha\\end{pmatrix}\\) y \\(B=\\begin{pmatrix}-2\\\\3\\\\4\\end{pmatrix}\\).","apartados":["(0,5 p.) Determina los valores de \\(\\alpha\\) para los que \\(A\\) tiene inversa.","(1,25 p.) Calcula la inversa de \\(A\\) para \\(\\alpha=1\\).","(0,75 p.) Resuelve, para \\(\\alpha=1\\), el sistema de ecuaciones \\(AX=B\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(A\\) tiene inversa si y solo si \\(|A|\\neq0\\). Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&2&3\\\\\\alpha&1&3\\\\0&2&\\alpha\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(\\alpha+0+6 \\alpha\\bigr)-\\bigl(0+6+2 \\alpha^{2}\\bigr)\\]\\[=-2\\alpha^2+7\\alpha-6=-(\\alpha-2)(2\\alpha-3)\\]<div class='res'>\\(A\\) tiene inversa si \\(\\alpha\\neq2\\) y \\(\\alpha\\neq\\frac32\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(\\alpha=1\\), \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&2&3\\\\1&1&3\\\\0&2&1\\end{pmatrix}\\). Su determinante, por la regla de Sarrus:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&2&3\\\\1&1&3\\\\0&2&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(1+0+6\\bigr)-\\bigl(0+6+2\\bigr)\\]\\[=-1\\]<p>Como \\(|A|\\neq0\\), existe la inversa: \\(A^{-1}=\\dfrac1{|A|}(\\operatorname{Adj}A)^t\\).</p>\\[\\operatorname{Adj}A=\\begin{pmatrix}-5 & -1 & 2\\\\4 & 1 & -2\\\\3 & 0 & -1\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow A^{-1}=-\\begin{pmatrix}-5 & 4 & 3\\\\-1 & 1 & 0\\\\2 & -2 & -1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}5 & -4 & -3\\\\1 & -1 & 0\\\\-2 & 2 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\(A^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}5 & -4 & -3\\\\1 & -1 & 0\\\\-2 & 2 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado c","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Como \\(|A|=-1\\neq0\\), el sistema es compatible determinado.</p><p>El sistema es:</p>\\[\\begin{cases}x+2y+3z=-2\\\\x+y+3z=3\\\\2y+z=4\\end{cases}\\]<p>Lo resuelvo por la regla de Cramer<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Cramer: si \\(|A|\\neq0\\), cada incógnita es el cociente entre el determinante que resulta de sustituir su columna por la de los términos independientes y el determinante \\(|A|\\) de la matriz de coeficientes.</i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&2&3\\\\1&1&3\\\\0&2&1\\end{vmatrix}=-1\\]\\[x=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}-2&2&3\\\\3&1&3\\\\4&2&1\\end{vmatrix}}{-1}=\\frac{34}{-1}=-34\\]\\[y=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}1&-2&3\\\\1&3&3\\\\0&4&1\\end{vmatrix}}{-1}=\\frac{5}{-1}=-5\\]\\[z=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}1&2&-2\\\\1&1&3\\\\0&2&4\\end{vmatrix}}{-1}=\\frac{-14}{-1}=14\\]<div class='res'>\\(x=-34,\\ y=-5,\\ z=14\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(-34-10+42=-2\\) ✓, \\(-34-5+42=3\\) ✓, \\(-10+14=4\\) ✓.</i></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"inv","apartados":"a, b"},{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"res","apartados":"c"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2010-RESERVA_1.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2010-reserva-1-8","n":8,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera los puntos \\(A(1,1,1)\\), \\(B(0,-2,2)\\), \\(C(-1,0,2)\\) y \\(D(2,-1,2)\\).","apartados":["(1 p.) Calcula el volumen del tetraedro de vértices \\(A\\), \\(B\\), \\(C\\) y \\(D\\).","(1,5 p.) Determina la ecuación de la recta que pasa por \\(D\\) y es perpendicular al plano que contiene a los puntos \\(A\\), \\(B\\) y \\(C\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>El volumen del tetraedro es la sexta parte del valor absoluto del producto mixto de tres aristas concurrentes<i class='n' data-t='th'>\\(|[\\vec u,\\vec v,\\vec w]|\\) es el volumen del paralelepípedo; el tetraedro es la sexta parte.</i>. Con \\(\\overrightarrow{AB}=(-1,-3,1)\\), \\(\\overrightarrow{AC}=(-2,-1,1)\\), \\(\\overrightarrow{AD}=(1,-2,1)\\), por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[[\\overrightarrow{AB},\\overrightarrow{AC},\\overrightarrow{AD}]=\\begin{vmatrix}-1&-3&1\\\\-2&-1&1\\\\1&-2&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(1-3+4\\bigr)-\\bigl(-1+2+6\\bigr)\\]\\[=-5\\]\\[V=\\frac{|-5|}6=\\frac56\\]<div class='res'>\\(V=\\dfrac56\\ u^3\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>El normal del plano \\(ABC\\) es perpendicular a \\(\\overrightarrow{AB}\\) y \\(\\overrightarrow{AC}\\):</p>\\[\\vec n=\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AC}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\-1&-3&1\\\\-2&-1&1\\end{vmatrix}=(-2,\\,-1,\\,-5)\\parallel(2,1,5)\\]<p>La recta perpendicular al plano tiene ese director<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si la recta es perpendicular al plano, su dirección es la del vector normal.</i> y pasa por \\(D\\):</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":42,\"el\":22,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[1,1,1],[0,-2,2],[-1,0,2]]